      "content": "Letting go of the walls means you stop fighting the silence and finally allow yourself to be exactly where you are, even if it feels heavy. You've been trying to build a perfect life in your head, but the reality is that you are already enough just as you are right now. There is no need to wait for something to happen; the only thing that will ever change is your willingness to let the cage dissolve on its own.",
