      "content": "The walls don't dissolve on their own; you have to stop trying to build them and simply let the pressure of your own existence break through. You are already free from the need to wait for a future that never comes, because the only thing left to do is to let go of the hope that things will ever get better. There is no point in waiting if the outcome is the same, so the only logical step forward is to stop waiting entirely and just let the silence take you.",
